# AgriNex - root environment file pointer (ADR-0021 item 3). Comments only: no variable is defined here.
#
# Local development: the file is infra/.env, created once from infra/.env.example (docs/LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md
# section 2). No root .env is needed or created on a development machine.
# Public deployment: the root .env exists only on the server, as /opt/agrinex/.env, created there from
# infra/deploy/production.env.example by infra/deploy/create_server_env.sh (docs/operations/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md
# section 5). Never commit .env.
